<title>USA: BOXING-DE LA HOYA KEEPS SUPER LIGHTWEIGHT CROWN BY DECISION. [CORRECTED 09:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>BOXING-DE LA HOYA KEEPS SUPER LIGHTWEIGHT CROWN BY DECISION. [CORRECTED 09:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Oscar de la Hoya scored a unanimous points decision over Miguel Angel Gonzalez of Mexico (corrects from Puerto Rico) on Saturday to retain his World Boxing Council super lightweight title.</p>
</text>
